50%` draws a circle:

    Details.svelte:369   height : 1.4em;
    Details.svelte:370   width  : 1.4em;

`aspect-ratio: 1` alone did nothing here — with both sides free the browser takes each from the `+` inside, which is taller than it is wide, so the shape came out an oval. Said in its own em, the circle is 17px at `--font-reset`, and it follows the font if that changes.

